---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="How to Update Salesforce from Slack Without Leaving Chat (2025)"
  description="Update Salesforce records directly from Slack with one-click actions. Change stages, update close dates, and add notes without switching apps. Compare the best tools."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="gradient-hero py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-200 text-sm mb-6">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M9 9h6v6H9z"/></svg>
          One-Click Actions
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
          Update Salesforce from Slack Without Leaving Chat
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Stop context switching. Update deal stages, close dates, and notes directly from Slack notifications with one click. Save hours every week.
        </p>
        <Button href="/trial" variant="primary" size="lg">
          Try One-Click Actions
        </Button>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4">14-day free trial. No credit card required.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Problem -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3" style="color: #061A35;">The Context-Switching Problem</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Sales reps switch between apps <strong>1,100 times per day</strong> on average. Every time you leave Slack to update Salesforce, you lose focus and waste time.
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm mt-6">
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-white rounded-lg">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-1">23 min</div>
              <p class="text-gray-600">to refocus after switching apps</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-white rounded-lg">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-1">5+ hours</div>
              <p class="text-gray-600">lost per week to CRM admin</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-white rounded-lg">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-1">79%</div>
              <p class="text-gray-600">of opportunity data never entered</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          How One-Click Salesforce Updates Work
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 text-center mb-12">
          Get a Slack notification, click a button, Salesforce is updated. That simple.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">1</div>
            <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Receive Alert in Slack</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">When something changes in Salesforce—new lead, stage change, stale deal—you get an instant notification in Slack with all the context you need.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">2</div>
            <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Click an Action Button</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Each alert includes action buttons: "Move to Negotiation," "Update Close Date," "Add Note," "Mark as Lost." One click is all it takes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">3</div>
            <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Salesforce Updates Instantly</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">The record updates in Salesforce immediately. You get a confirmation in Slack. No tabs to open, no forms to fill, no time wasted.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What You Can Update -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          What Can You Update from Slack?
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Change Stage</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Move opportunities through your pipeline with one click. "Move to Demo," "Move to Proposal," "Move to Closed Won."</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Update Close Date</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Push close dates forward or back without opening Salesforce. Keep forecasts accurate with less effort.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Add Notes</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Log meeting notes, call summaries, or next steps directly from Slack. Notes sync to the Salesforce record instantly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M16 8h-6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4h4a2 2 0 1 1 0 4H8"/><path d="M12 18V6"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Update Amount</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Adjust deal values as negotiations progress. Click to increase or decrease the opportunity amount.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Reassign Owner</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Transfer leads or opportunities to a teammate without logging into Salesforce. Quick handoffs, smooth transitions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6b7280" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M9 9h6v6H9z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Custom Actions</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Create your own action buttons for any Salesforce field. Update custom fields, picklists, or checkboxes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison Table -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Compare Slack-to-Salesforce Tools
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 text-center mb-12">
          Not all integrations let you update Salesforce from Slack. Here's what each offers.
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse bg-white text-gray-700">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-gray-100">
                <th class="text-left p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Feature</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Native SF for Slack</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Zapier</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Rattle</th>
                <th class="text-center p-4 border border-gray-200 font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">Pyko</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Update from Slack</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Limited</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">One-Click Actions</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Custom Action Buttons</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Microsoft Teams</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">HubSpot Support</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Yes</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-red-500">No</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">Yes</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Real-Time Alerts</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">Via Flow</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">5-15 min delay</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center">~1 min</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-green-600 font-semibold">&lt;3 seconds</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-white">
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 font-medium text-gray-900">Pricing</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm">Free (limited)</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm">From $20/mo</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center text-sm">Contact sales</td>
                <td class="p-4 border border-gray-200 text-center font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">From €3.99/user</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Pyko Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#061A35] to-[#0A2342]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] text-white text-sm font-medium mb-4">Recommended</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            Why Pyko for Slack-to-Salesforce Updates
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
            One-click actions that actually save time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M9 9h6v6H9z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">True One-Click</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">No modals, no forms, no confirmation dialogs. Click a button, Salesforce updates. That's it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Customizable Actions</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Create action buttons for any Salesforce field. Match your sales process exactly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Works in Teams Too</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Same one-click actions in Microsoft Teams. Not just Slack.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Instant Sync</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Updates sync to Salesforce in under a second. No delays, no failed syncs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <Button href="/trial" variant="primary" size="lg">
            Try One-Click Actions Free
          </Button>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4">14-day free trial. No credit card required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Can I update Salesforce from Slack without opening Salesforce?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. With tools like Pyko and Rattle, you can update Salesforce records directly from Slack using action buttons. No need to open Salesforce at all.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Does the native Salesforce for Slack app let me update records?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">The native app has limited update capabilities. You can search and view records, but updating requires opening Salesforce. Third-party tools like Pyko offer true one-click updates.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Can I update Salesforce from Microsoft Teams?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. Pyko supports both Slack and Microsoft Teams, with the same one-click update functionality in both platforms.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">What Salesforce fields can I update from Slack?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">With Pyko, you can update any standard or custom field: stage, close date, amount, owner, notes, picklists, checkboxes, and more. You define which actions appear on each alert.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Is it secure to update Salesforce from Slack?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. Pyko uses OAuth to connect securely to Salesforce. Updates are made with the user's permissions, so they can only change records they have access to in Salesforce.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">How much time can one-click actions save?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Sales reps typically save 5+ hours per week on CRM admin work. Each update takes seconds instead of minutes, and you never lose focus by switching apps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <CTASection
    headline="Stop switching between apps"
    subheadline="Update Salesforce from Slack with one click. Save hours every week."
    primaryCTA={{ text: "Start Free 14-Day Trial", href: "/trial" }}
    secondaryCTA={{ text: "See All Features", href: "/product/actions" }}
    variant="gradient"
  />
</MainLayout>
